WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.631
"Oh no!" Tom yelled.

2
00:00:05.632 --> 00:00:10.681
The trout was very strong.

3
00:00:10.682 --> 00:00:14.919
It flopped back into the water.

4
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.624
Jeremy's rod flew through the air.

5
00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:21.453
So did Jeremy and Tom!

6
00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:34.250
Splash! Splash!

7
00:00:34.251 --> 00:00:38.826
Tom and Jeremy climbed back on the boat.

8
00:00:38.827 --> 00:00:42.694
Tom looked at his wet clothes.

9
00:00:42.695 --> 00:00:48.280
"Mother will be very angry," he said.

10
00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:52.563
Jeremy started paddling the boat again.

11
00:00:52.564 --> 00:00:56.399
"I don't like fishing," Tom said.

12
00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.778
"Me neither," Jeremy said.

13
00:00:59.779 --> 00:01:03.114
"Shall we look for flowers now?"

14
00:01:03.115 --> 00:01:05.651
Tom looked down.

15
00:01:05.652 --> 00:01:12.348
His clothes were a mess.

16
00:01:12.349 --> 00:01:17.986
"Oh, I have another idea!" he said.

17
00:01:17.987 --> 00:01:28.094
Tom ran home.

18
00:01:28.099 --> 00:01:32.047
Mrs. Twitchit's friends were there.

19
00:01:32.048 --> 00:01:38.899
Everyone was sipping tea.

20
00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.995
"Tom!" Mrs. Twitchit said.

21
00:01:42.996 --> 00:01:44.905
"You're all wet.

22
00:01:44.906 --> 00:01:47.721
And where are the flowers?"

23
00:01:47.722 --> 00:01:50.092
Tom smiled.

24
00:01:50.093 --> 00:01:53.799
"I couldn't find any flowers, Mother.

25
00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.657
But I have a better surprise."

26
00:01:56.658 --> 00:01:59.859
Tom reached into his pocket.

27
00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:04.546
He pulled out . . . wiggling worms!

28
00:02:04.547 --> 00:02:09.634
Mittens and Moppet giggled.

29
00:02:09.635 --> 00:02:14.848
Mrs. Twitchit's friends laughed.

30
00:02:14.849 --> 00:02:25.292
Everyone liked Tom's surprise—except Mother!

